{
	"info": {
		"name": "Decidiq Implementation Progress",
		"description": "followup-implementation-progress (tasks 1, 2 and 5). Seeds an adopted motion with an implementation update 100 days old and a rejected motion, checks that the newest update sets the motion's implementation status and that a rejected motion takes no update (422), and, in the second folder, that OpenRegister's scheduled notification run told the secretariat \"No progress reported: <title>\".\n\nThe scheduled rule fires from OpenRegister's background job, which no HTTP call can start. Run it in two passes:\n\n  newman run tests/newman/implementation-progress.json --folder Seed --export-environment /tmp/ip.json\n  docker exec -u www-data nextcloud php cron.php\n  newman run tests/newman/implementation-progress.json -e /tmp/ip.json --folder Reminder --folder Teardown\n\nsecretariatUser must be a member of decidiq-secretariat.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"auth": {
		"type": "noauth"
	},
